under CC BY 4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Source and attribution policy: https://open-meteo.com/en/licence
Daily values are selected/rounded and display labels derived by Alder.
Source/license links must accompany displayed data; this notice alone is not
a substitute. Free-service access is limited to noncommercial use, separately
from the data license: https://open-meteo.com/en/terms
The hosted promotional demo needs the service decision recorded in
docs/weather-service-review.md before live weather is enabled.
